We have completed the initial technical investigation for the NERC Training Expiration Notification requirement.

We identified an existing SailPoint notification task, associated rules, training policy libraries, and email template that already support configurable advance notifications and user/manager email delivery. We also confirmed that the existing policy logic evaluates required training and the Revoke on Expired Training entitlement configuration.

During the analysis, we identified a potential gap where the current notification process sends reminders even when no affected entitlement is identified. This behavior needs to be validated against the new requirement before making changes.

In TEST, we successfully validated the SAP Training Module JDBC Preview and identified training records expiring within the next 30 days.

Next steps: Identify records matching the exact 30/15/7-day milestones, execute the existing notification task in scan-only mode, validate the results and entitlement eligibility, and finalize any required code or email-template changes before end-to-end testing.

No changes have been deployed, and notification testing is still pending.
